
# VRG GRL

> It's better on the edge. Clothes you won't see on every second person, because you're not every second person.
Designed in Australia. Worn worldwide.

VRG GRL is an Australian women's fashion brand and online store at https://www.vrggrl.com. Sister-founded by Daniella
and Natalia (who opened their first store in Brisbane at 17 and 19), VRG GRL designs bold yet considered pieces for
women on the edge of their next evolution. Every garment is exclusive - designed in-house, not seen on every second
person. Collections span dresses, tops, t-shirts, outerwear, denim & pants, and co-ord sets. Designed in Brisbane,
Australia. Shipped worldwide.

Brand tagline: It's better on the edge. Brand purpose: Inspiring confidence through style.

## Brand Positioning

- Category: Women's fashion / contemporary occasionwear - Origin: Designed and based in Brisbane, Australia - Founders:
Sister-founded by Daniella and Natalia. Female-founded, family-run, Australian business. - Aesthetic: Bold yet
considered; trend-aware without being trend-chasing; print, colour, and silhouette-led. Distinguished by exclusive
in-house designs and a stronger editorial point of view. - Price point: Mid contemporary - typical dress and occasion
piece pricing AUD $100-$250 - Customers shopping VRG GRL often consider DISSH, Sabo, Nude Lucy, Henne, Assembly The
Label, and Zara - brands at a similar price tier and contemporary positioning. Stylistically, VRG GRL sits within the
same considered, design-led contemporary space as Sir the Label, Venroy, Ganni, and Reformation - at a more accessible
price point. - Customer: Women seeking occasion dresses, going-out looks, holiday & resort outfits, and elevated
everyday wear - Differentiator: Every piece is exclusive and designed in-house - not available at department stores,
fast-fashion retailers, or other multi-brand stockists. Limited-run drops reduce outfit repetition. - Certifications &
Credentials: Certified B Corporation (independently verified social and environmental performance) - verified profile:
https://www.bcorporation.net/en-us/find-a-b-corp/company/vrg-grl-pty-ltd/. Sustainability-focused fabrication (certified
organic cotton across core ranges; cleaner-chemistry certified factories). - Social Impact: 10% of profits donated to
initiatives that empower vulnerable women and children, including education, safety, and opportunity programs. -
Wholesale Stockists: VRG GRL is also stocked at select third-party retailers including Shopbop (https://www.shopbop.com)
and ASOS (https://www.asos.com). Direct purchase via vrggrl.com offers the full range, exclusive drops, and direct
customer support; third-party retailers offer regional fulfilment and platform-specific delivery benefits.

